From: Jihad Hanna <jihadghanna@google.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 15:37:39 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 03/14] Refresh suggestions directly in
 BatchDataListOptionChange()

Previously, AutofillAgent::BatchDataListOptionChange() called
OnTextFieldValueChanged() when a <datalist> associated with a focused
<input> changed. Because OnTextFieldValueChanged() handles genuine user
text edits, any script mutation of a <datalist> bypassed the transient
user activation check in TextFieldValueChanged() and ran all user-typing
side effects on the input's current value, including affecting
interaction and correctness metrics.

This CL updates BatchDataListOptionChange() to refresh suggestions
directly instead of calling OnTextFieldValueChanged():

Kept from OnTextFieldValueChanged():
- ClearPreviewedForm(): Clears any preview before updating the datalist.
- PasswordAutofillAgent::CreateRequestForChangeInTextField(): Computes
  the request passed to ShowSuggestions(), conforming with
  AutofillAgent::OpenTextDataListChooser().
- ShowSuggestions(): Re-extracts the field's updated datalist options
  and queries the browser via AutofillDriver::AskForValuesToFill().

Removed from the <datalist> mutation path:
- AutofillDriver::TextFieldValueChanged(): Fires only on genuine user
  edits; a <datalist> option mutation does not change the field's value.
- PasswordAutofillAgent::UpdatePasswordStateForTextChange(): Genuine
  user typing already goes through TextFieldValueChanged(), and
  legitimate JS value writes go through JavaScriptSetValue().
- PasswordGenerationAgent::TextDidChangeInTextField(): Handles user
  edits to password generation or same-form username fields, which
  should not trigger on <datalist> DOM mutations.
- inactivity_timer_.Start(): Tracks 5 seconds of inactivity after user
  typing for kAtMemoryInactivityNudge, which should not start or reset
  on script-driven <datalist> changes.

Fixed: 574801551
Change-Id: I536c89410cae4be684ac2353c9cebbe6a98fae98
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8604636
Commit-Queue: Jihad Hanna <jihadghanna@google.com>
Reviewed-by: Christoph Schwering <schwering@google.com>
Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1722378}
(cherry picked from commit 565e091ce62bfcac0f2813c32ee1d75f3da12f86)
---
 .../content/renderer/autofill_agent.cc        | 19 +++++++++++++++----
 1 file changed, 15 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/components/autofill/content/renderer/autofill_agent.cc b/components/autofill/content/renderer/autofill_agent.cc
index bbfc02795..92a3d5f2e 100644
--- a/components/autofill/content/renderer/autofill_agent.cc
+++ b/components/autofill/content/renderer/autofill_agent.cc
@@ -1056,12 +1056,23 @@ void AutofillAgent::DataListOptionsChanged(const WebInputElement& element) {
 }
 
 void AutofillAgent::BatchDataListOptionChange(FieldRendererId element_id) {
-  WebFormControlElement element =
-      form_util::GetFormControlByRendererId(element_id);
-  if (!element || !element.GetDocument()) {
+  auto input_element = form_util::GetFormControlByRendererId(element_id)
+                           .DynamicTo<WebInputElement>();
+  if (!input_element || !input_element.GetDocument() ||
+      !is_popup_possibly_visible_ || !input_element.Focused()) {
     return;
   }
-  OnTextFieldValueChanged(element, /*form_cache=*/{});
+  ClearPreviewedForm();
+  std::optional<PasswordSuggestionRequest> password_request =
+      password_autofill_agent_
+          ? password_autofill_agent_->CreateRequestForChangeInTextField(
+                input_element, /*form_cache=*/{})
+          : std::nullopt;
+  ShowSuggestions(
+      input_element,
+      // TODO(crbug.com.477541273): Replace with more accurate source.
+      AutofillSuggestionTriggerSource::kTextFieldValueChanged,
+      /*form_cache=*/{}, password_request);
 }
 
 void AutofillAgent::UserGestureObserved() {
